blocks.en:
Table 5 : Ablation study. “Random” randomly selects 30 heads;
“Layer-matched” randomly selects each head from the same layers as ours;
“Reversed” selects the 30 heads in reverse ranking;
“All Heads” intervenes on all attention heads. “Ours w/o suppressing” only increases attention to the trusted modality without suppressing the other modality.

blocks.zh:
表5:阅读研究。 “随机”随机选择30个头;
随机从与我们相同的层次上选出每个头;
“退后”按倒数排名选择30个头;
“所有负责人”对所有关注的负责人发言。 “我们的w/o压制”只会增加对信任模式的关注,而不抑制另一种模式。
